---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="features" class="container mx-auto px-4 py-20">
  <div class="mb-16 text-center">
    <p class="mb-2 text-xs text-gray-300 md:text-sm">
      src/components/sections/Features.astro
    </p>
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold text-white">Características</h2>
    <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-slate-300 text-pretty">
      Todo lo que se necesita para comenzar un proyecto con
      <span
        class="relative inline-block before:absolute before:-inset-1 before:block before:skew-y-3 before:bg-linear-to-r before:from-orange-pantone before:to-medium-slate-blue"
      >
        <span class="relative font-semibold text-white">Astro</span>
      </span> de forma rápida y eficiente
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <div
      class="p-6 transition-all duration-300 border rounded-lg bg-slate-800/50 border-slate-700 hover:border-orange-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-orange-500/10"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-white rounded-lg bg-linear-to-r from-orange-500 to-orange-600"
      >
        <Icon name="astro" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Astro v5</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        Configurado para contenido estático con la última versiónl.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="p-6 transition-all duration-300 border rounded-lg bg-slate-800/50 border-slate-700 hover:border-purple-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-purple-500/10"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-white rounded-lg bg-linear-to-r from-purple-500 to-purple-600"
      >
        <Icon name="tailwindcss" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">TailwindCSS v4</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        Estilos rápidos y modernos con la última versión.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="p-6 transition-all duration-300 border rounded-lg bg-slate-800/50 border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/10"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-white rounded-lg bg-linear-to-r from-blue-500 to-blue-600"
      >
        <Icon name="typescript" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">TypeScript v5</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        Configuración optimizada con tsconfig.json para mejor desarrollo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="p-6 transition-all duration-300 border rounded-lg bg-slate-800/50 border-slate-700 hover:border-green-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/10"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-white rounded-lg bg-linear-to-r from-green-500 to-green-600"
      >
        <Icon name="biome" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Biome v2</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">Para lintear y formatear el código.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
